1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
一朵松茸，一斤上千块
One matsutake — ¥1000+ a pound

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
它金贵在哪？
Why so precious?

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
松茸，种不出来
Matsutake can't be farmed

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
只跟松栎树根共生
It lives only with pine-oak roots

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,000
人一插手，它就不长
Meddle, and it won't grow

6
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
只能等雨后进山捡
You wait for rain, then forage

7
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,000
采菌人天不亮上山
Pickers climb before dawn

8
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,000
香格里拉，国家地理标志
Shangri-La — a geographic-indication origin

9
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,000
品相好的，一斤1000到1500
Top grade: ¥1000–1500 a pound

10
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,000
冷链也只保鲜五天
Even cold-chain holds just 5 days

11
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,000
它的贵，是野生的贵
Its price is the price of wild

12
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,000
下集：蚂蚁"种"的菌中之王
Next: king of mushrooms, "farmed" by ants
